{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_lin_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_lin_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"新潮旧浪","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_lin_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"f233012681714826113936c04be82ae291332a4fb7cdeb17ad121ea210008055","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"从玉门回来后，鼠王宣布，女儿林雨霞将接替他成为贫民窟新的话事人。一时间，全龙门的视线都聚焦在了贫民窟......","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcity_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"局长，按照您的指示，我们的人已经把贫民窟大大小小的出入口都盯住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"很好。轮好班，今天别让一只鼷兽溜进去，也别让一只鼷兽溜出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"局长，这么兴师动众，会不会起反效果？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"鼠王宣布让林小姐继承衣钵以来，已经过了半个月了，贫民窟没发生什么事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，那只臭老鼠也失踪了半个月了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"贫民窟的话事人新旧交替，什么都没发生，你信吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"瘦子张、师爷李、鬼眼......这些被鼠王压了这么多年的老滑头们什么都不做，你信吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"今天，瘦子张把臭老鼠手下的人带走了，她不可能不行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......林小姐应该能摆平。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"但我不需要她来摆平。贫民窟是龙门的一部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也对，这点我支持你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"盯好你那边的人，那边肯定也会有动作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"放心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"给我等着，死老鼠。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"大家呢，都喜欢在酒吧里喝酒跳舞，我是个俗人，偏爱在酒吧里吃火锅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"以前，我林大哥也时常光顾这里，和我们兄弟几个吃香喝辣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜啊，下周这家酒吧就要拆了，今天在这里吃最后一顿，也算给这里送行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"来，吃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胆怯的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"汪老弟怎么不动筷子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"汪老弟在我的地盘上建医院都敢不跟我说一声，怎么吃一顿火锅反而不敢了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胆怯的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"造医院......是林姐的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"你瞧瞧，我就说啊，现在的年轻人不会做事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"你林姐是什么人？鼠王的接班人，日理万机！这样的人物，忘了一两件小事有什么问题？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"我们做小弟的，最重要的不就是要为大佬分忧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？汪老弟，你说说，究竟是你忘了，还是我林侄女忘了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胆怯的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是、是我忘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"那不就对了，你林姐见了我，也要叫我一声叔叔，她怎么会不和我打声招呼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"都是误会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"汪老弟，我看你一直在抖，身子骨有点虚啊，而且你的记忆力也不太好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"这样，你把这锅火锅汤趁热喝了，补补身子，然后去给我侄女报个信，好不好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胆怯的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这......我......张先生，您放过我吧......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"商人颤抖着想要站起来给瘦子张下跪，但一只手按住了他的肩膀。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"瞧瞧是谁来了？我的林侄女！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"侄女，不是张叔说你，手下的人这么畏畏缩缩，怎么能干成大事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"当年张叔为了不给你爸丢人，可是当着好几个大佬的面，把盘子咬碎了咽下去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在不比张叔当年，如今做生意讲究的是和气生财。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小汪妻子要生产了，让他回去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"张叔既然想找的是我，我来陪你吃火锅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"那敢情好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小汪，回去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胆怯的商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，林姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不怪你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"来，侄女，吃菜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"张叔，你是长辈，有什么话，你大可以直接告诉我，何必多此一举。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"这些年，你的能力大家都看在眼里，林大哥如今把话事人的位子交给你，我支持。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"江湖上最讲究“规矩”两个字，既然你是话事人，张叔当然不能用对晚辈的态度对你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"张叔对我的态度，倒也不像是对话事人，而像是对敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，侄女这话就过了。混江湖，没有规矩，不成方圆，但不讲情义，又何来立足之地？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"侄女不声不响地在我的地盘上大兴土木，这是摆明了要拆我的台。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"我也只是想提醒一下侄女，有些事，不要搞得大家脸上都不好看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我说，我是特意没有通知张叔的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"瞧瞧，谁说我侄女不会开玩笑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"张叔误会了，我没在开玩笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"......侄女该不会是以为，坐上话事人的位置，就可以为所欲为了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我坐上话事人的位置，是为了不让某些人为所欲为。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"这件事，我林大哥知道吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"张叔刚才也说了，现在我才是话事人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"看来，今天我得替我林大哥好好管教一下女儿了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"胖坤，来跟我林侄女一起吃顿火锅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_b"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胖坤","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"叫上弟兄们，都带上家伙什。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胖坤的手下","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"坤哥，我们真的要对那位林小姐下手？她不是新话事人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胖坤","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，当话事人也要下面的人支持才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胖坤","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"她刚上位就敢越过张哥在这里搞事，真当贫民窟是她林家的地盘了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胖坤的手下","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但、但她毕竟是鼠王的女儿，这背后难保没有鼠王的意思......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胖坤","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"以鼠王他老人家的脾性，他要动张哥，还用得着借他女儿的手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胖坤的手下","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这......难道鼠王就任由他女儿乱来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胖坤","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"林小姐做事的风格跟鼠王不一样，这点大家都知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胖坤","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"她喜欢跟白道上的家伙们打交道，这点大家也都看在眼里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胖坤","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"只是没想到，她会做得这么绝。一上位，直接把贫民窟几十年来的规矩一脚踢开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胖坤","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"我看啊，连鼠王也未必料得到，自己的女儿敢做这么忘本的事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胖坤","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"你听好了，我们不是要对林小姐动手，我们是要替鼠王教育教育他的女儿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胖坤的手下","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"坤哥教训的是，我这下明白了！我这就召集兄弟们！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来张叔早有准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，就是让下面的人也来吃一顿，热闹热闹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"张叔也是要给林大哥交代的，不会对你做什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"张叔还是不明白，我爸已经不管事了，你想对他有什么交代？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"林大哥说不管事，就真能不管了？贫民窟上上下下有多少人还是只听他的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"侄女真以为，没有那些人的支持，你能当这个话事人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有自己的人脉，也有自己的生意，这些和我爸都没有关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，侄女，听张叔一句劝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"年轻人想撇下我们这些老东西，觉得我们跟不上时代，我懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，有些东西，不是你想撇下，就能撇下的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"退一步说，你今天让张叔下不来台，明天林大哥想和老兄弟叙叙旧，还怎么叙？后天，你王姨想和你母亲一起去逛街，这街还逛不逛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"你这孩子平时做事滴水不漏，到这一点上怎么就犯傻了呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是张叔太把人情当回事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"你这孩子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"罢了罢了，本来张叔也不想做得这么绝，不过，看来是得给你下一剂猛药清醒清醒了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，老李啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"医院的事，落实一下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"李总裁","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"王局，还记得我吗？我是瑞翔建筑的李敏恒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王局长","speakerId":"avg_npc_271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"记得，怎么不记得。托李总的福，我才知道大地上还有那等美食。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"李总裁","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，知道王局长对美食有讲究，我才特地托人从雷姆必拓搞了一些山珍过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王局长","speakerId":"avg_npc_271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以可以，我就知道，你这个朋友交得值得。以后有什么需要我帮忙的，尽管说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"李总裁","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，不瞒您说，贫民窟的医院，您知道吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王局长","speakerId":"avg_npc_271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，这事可不小，老百姓都关注得很。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王局长","speakerId":"avg_npc_271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，它的竞标已经结束了吧？我记得，是贫民窟的一家公司中标了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"李总裁","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，您也知道，我们小本生意，想做出头不容易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"李总裁","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这项工程，我们原本势在必得，谁知道被贫民窟的人抢了头筹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王局长","speakerId":"avg_npc_271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"话虽如此，老李，那家公司是合法竞标、合法中标的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"李总裁","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，但您可能没发现，他们提交的文件里，有点纰漏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王局长","speakerId":"avg_npc_271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王局长","speakerId":"avg_npc_271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你确定？只是一点小问题的话，可没法改变结果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"李总裁","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，它也有可能影响结果，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"李总裁","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是想先和您打一声招呼，之后我们投诉的时候，您只需要点个头就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"李总裁","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他的事，绝不会烦扰到您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"李总裁","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从玻利瓦尔又搞了一些好货，下个月送到，到时请您来尝尝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王局长","speakerId":"avg_npc_271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈哈，好好，没问题！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，这下，侄女可以安心吃火锅了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有些问题想先问问张叔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"你问，只要是张叔知道的，都可以告诉你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"龙门常会接收一些荒野上的流民，这些流民大多被安置在贫民窟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了防止流民数量过于臃肿，魏总督受命和其他国家洽谈，签订了一系列的援助合约，旨在让背井离乡的人能够回到家乡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是每到这种时候，总会发生一些失踪案件，有的是人到了地方却消失了，有的则是人明明不在援助名单上，却从贫民窟消失了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一开始以为只是巧合，但随着调查的展开，我发现是有人借着援助的名义，在进行人口贩卖的勾当。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"张叔确实好算计，每次都会联络不同的买家，卖出去的人也都会有意地打散，把他们送去不同的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我花了几年，终于找到一点线索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"张叔还认得这些照片上的人吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"林雨霞从随身的提包中取出几张照片，照片中是几个瘦弱的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"不记得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜也是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_b"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胖坤","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"都准备好了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胖坤的手下","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是，弟兄们都过来了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胖坤的手下","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什么人？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胖坤的手下","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咕......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胖坤","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"谁敢在张哥的地盘撒野！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胖坤","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"咕哈......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胖坤","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你到底是什么人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞的手下","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出来吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞的手下","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是他吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"......没错，是他，我永远记得他的嗓音......就是他害死我爸的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"我也记得！是他，是他害我在乌萨斯的矿场待了十几年！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"没错......没错......化成灰我都记得他身上的纹身......是他没错，是他把我卖到了雷姆必拓！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞的手下","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他现在动不了了，林小姐说了，你们想怎么样都行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"这些人见到胖坤，脸上又惊又怒，听到林雨霞的手下这么说后，其中几人壮着胆子上去给了胖坤几脚。\n但大多数人，还是畏缩地站在后面。\n他们脸上更多的，还是这些年在外担惊受怕的恐惧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞的手下","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，林小姐让我向你们保证，从今往后，你们夜里再也不会做噩梦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞的手下","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"都不许动！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"附近有斗殴声，怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞的手下","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们看，龙门近卫局会为你们主持公道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是臭老鼠的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞的手下","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"诗怀雅局长，我在这里代替林小姐向您举报，张文浩手下的胖坤一行人，这些年来一直都在进行人口买卖的违法勾当。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞的手下","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人证就在这里，物证......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞的手下","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞的手下","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信您会还这些人一片朗朗乾坤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"......*龙门粗口*，臭老鼠，算计好了是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞的手下","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"林小姐只是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"行了。把胖坤这伙人带走，然后把这些证人保护起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"臭老鼠的人也别想跑，带回去做个笔录。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"局长，您要去哪儿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"......吃个火锅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"侄女有所不知，当初有多个国外的黑帮想要在贫民窟扎根。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"林大哥虽然厉害，却也双拳难敌四手，若非我扛下了这部分压力，林大哥未必能在贫民窟站稳脚跟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"侄女，你当时还未出生，不知道其中的险恶，我不怪你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸常说，若不是你当年主动站出来，贫民窟难免又是一场腥风血雨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但爸不知道，他感激的人，暗中却和这些黑帮达成了合作，协助他们进行人口买卖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"当时是形势所迫！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总有办法。就算当时没有办法，后来也该有办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"张叔，时至今日，到底有多少是形势所迫，有多少是掩耳盗铃，又有多少......是无法自拔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"侄女，你没经历过当年的事，就别拿一副什么都懂的语气来说这些话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我确实没经历过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但有些事，我宁可没有亲身经历。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"张叔，你去找过这些人吗？帮助过他们吗？为他们做过什么吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你见过他们在物是人非的旧宅前失落的样子吗？见过他们在亲人的坟前哭吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"......侄女，省省吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"你难道以为，说这些话就能让我动摇吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"张叔知道的，我没有这么天真。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是给张叔提个醒，怕张叔忘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，这张照片上的人，张叔肯定记得。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"林雨霞又从包中取出另一张照片。\n照片上，是瘦子张、李总裁和王局长在酒席上欢声笑语的场面。\n瘦子张的面色瞬间阴沉了下来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_uptown_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"长官，姓李的离开王局长办公室了，怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你们去盯着姓李的，我去和王局长谈谈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王局长","speakerId":"avg_npc_271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王局长","speakerId":"avg_npc_271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王局长","speakerId":"avg_npc_271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......请进。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"王局长，我是近卫局的督察星熊，有些话想和你聊一聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王局长","speakerId":"avg_npc_271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"近卫局的长官，您来得正好，我要向您举报......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王局长","speakerId":"avg_npc_271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，是自首。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王局长","speakerId":"avg_npc_271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我自首，我在过去包庇了部分企业的违法竞标行为。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王局长","speakerId":"avg_npc_271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同时，我举报，瑞翔建筑的李敏恒，想要非法改变贫民窟医院的中标结果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王局长","speakerId":"avg_npc_271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他刚才来找过我，我把我们的对话全部录音了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王局长","speakerId":"avg_npc_271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，他背后的首恶，贫民窟的张文浩，这些年来多次用贿赂和暴力手段暗中控制商业招标竞标活动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王局长","speakerId":"avg_npc_271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我手上有充足的证据。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......是谁让你这么做的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"王局长","speakerId":"avg_npc_271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没有人，长官，这都是我自愿的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......林小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"真是了不起。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“李敏恒”......对许多贫民窟的人来说，这个名字不算陌生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"许多贫民窟的基建都是他的公司承办的，说他是贫民窟的大善人也不为过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我始终记得，小时候爸告诉我，贫民窟的这些楼、那些厅是张叔的朋友李先生建的时，心中对他的感激。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至可以说，我想要为贫民窟建第一所公立医院的契机，就来自他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，当我自己学习这些知识，踏上这条道路后，我才知道，他和政府官员勾结，骗取了多少投资和补助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些我曾经引以为傲的建筑，实际上都是用便宜的材料以次充好造的。他从建筑款中榨取的利润，数以千万计。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而唆使他走上这条道路的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是你，张叔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"......是他先找到我的，是他先跟我说，这里面大有可为。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你先，还是他先，有什么区别呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最终，是你们共同攫取了贫民窟万千穷苦人家应得的利益，化作自己享乐的资本。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"这些年，有些事，张叔确实瞒了你爸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"有些是身不由己，有些是一念之差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"想到这些事，心中对林大哥总是愧疚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"被侄女点出来，这么一承认，心里反而释然了一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"只不过，这样的话，张叔今天就更不能让你走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，侄女，你得跟张叔走一趟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"等到我安全——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"老李，怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"李总裁","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老张，救我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"李总裁","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"近卫局的人忽然找到我，把我带进局子了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"你说什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"李总裁","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂，老张，别挂——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"......啧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"胖坤也在局子里了，想见自己去局子里见。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"通讯声还没响两下，诗怀雅就从酒吧门口走了进来，随手把胖坤的通讯终端丢在瘦子张的面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"张叔还要打电话吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以替你打，师爷李、鬼眼、王经理、陈部长......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"林雨霞说着，从包中掏出通讯终端，盯住瘦子张。\n瘦子张没有理会林雨霞，手握着通讯终端，靠在椅子上，脸色不断变化。\n大势已去。\n最终，他闭上眼，深深呼出一口气。\n一瞬间，他仿佛老了十岁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"张叔，出来混，早晚都是要还的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"......你王姨怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会亲自去向王姨说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小张哥的学业也不会受到影响。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"当年，我也和你一样，以为自己能守住原则。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"结果一步错，步步错啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"替我跟林大哥说一声，就说......张文浩对不起他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦子张","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"诗怀雅局长，带我去见胖坤和老李吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"警车就在外面，还要我送你吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小时候，张叔对我很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还记得八岁的时候，有一次，他为了逗我开心，把他新买的高档手表丢进了井里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"那你还真是一只没心没肺的死老鼠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"别以为我会领你的情，近卫局本来就快抓到瘦子张的把柄了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是在解决家里的顽垢而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"喔，那还真了不起啊，我们的林女侠，刚从玉门回来，就帮近卫局除掉了一根眼中钉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"不仅能神不知鬼不觉地把人带进贫民窟，就连政府财务部门的人也能影响。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"要不然我去和魏总督说一声，你来当这个局长，好不好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有些事，现在只能这么做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贫民窟跟龙门之间隔着的那堵墙，要慢慢拆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我不知道，我还会好声好气地在这里跟你说话？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"你猜我把贫民窟围起来，是为了抓你，还是为了保你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你没蠢到非要今天抓我不可，也没好心到如果我露出破绽，还会放我离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"知道就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"在你父亲的时代，龙门需要贫民窟。但这不代表，龙门永远需要贫民窟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"别告诉我，你忘了我们中学时说过的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“没有人生来就该在贫民窟里过日子，总有一天，贫民窟里的人，也可以生活在阳光下。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没忘，但我怕某个当初爽约的人忘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"小心眼的女人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"这件事你还打算念几年？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是没心没肺的死老鼠，能有一件事拿来损你，当然会念到你死为止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，跟你聊天真是气人，我早晚得让星熊给我常备降压药。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，反正，只要你还记得这句话，你还知道自己是在为谁谋福祉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"近卫局不会是你的阻碍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这算是近卫局局长给我这个普通市民颁发的免死金牌吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么不理解成是近卫局局长给你这个普通市民上的镣铐呢？"},{"type":"narration","text":"诗怀雅说着，从怀中掏出一副手铐。\n一边铐在林雨霞的手上，另一边，铐在自己手上。\n林雨霞并没有反抗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎么说，你得跟我回去做个笔录。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"今天的事，给我一个交代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼，在贫民窟里跑了半天，我肚子都饿扁了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"先吃点火锅！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"臭老鼠，快下点菜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么非得我来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"我这只手铐住了，动起来不方便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rooftop_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林舸瑞","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"一把年纪了，又受了伤，一个人爬这么高也不怕摔着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林舸瑞","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"老朋友走了，腿脚不便，浇一碗酒，就当送别了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"是腿脚不便，还是没有脸面？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林舸瑞","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"......老友，你还记得当年那个拍着胸脯跟你说，只要有他在，就绝不会让你我少一根毫毛的愣头青吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"记得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林舸瑞","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"他为我做事三十年，我也让他享了三十年的福。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林舸瑞","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，我也没想到，他瞒了我那么多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林舸瑞","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"我没什么对不起他的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"但你下不了手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你也没想到你女儿会如此果断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"堂堂贫民窟的鼠王，躲在这里不想见女儿，说出去也不怕遭人笑话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林舸瑞","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"此言差矣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林舸瑞","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"如今我已不是鼠王，只是一个喜欢逛街弄羽的糟老头子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林舸瑞","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"女儿的成长超乎想象，我这个糟老头子高兴还来不及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你倒想得开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林舸瑞","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"我当然想得开，毕竟就算现在不想见，等会儿也要在一张桌子上吃饭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林舸瑞","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"反倒是我们的大少爷你，怕是想见也见不到啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......哪壶不开提哪壶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我依然是那句话，她若是打算回来，龙门会是她最好的后盾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林舸瑞","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林舸瑞","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"老友，我们都老了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林舸瑞","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"但龙门的未来，交给这些后生，我还算放心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你再这么说下去，老得更快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林舸瑞","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["近卫局成员"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["星熊"]},{"speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","aliases":["魏彦吾"]},{"speakerId":"char_308_swire","aliases":["诗怀雅"]}]}
